00:04:58.920 --> 00:04:59.860
<v Mike>the animation in general.

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:06.920
<v Mike>And that's because the game is an adaptation of, uh, like a French comic about the American

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:12.020
