<v Sean>maybe it, maybe it's beloved in Belgium or wherever the fuck it's from, but.

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:58.340
<v Mike>Oh, you're right. No, it is Belgium.

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:06.140
<v Sean>Yeah. But it, to us, it just looks like a cartoonish version of the civil war, which is a choice in

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:09.940
