00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:52.120
<v Mike>But like, it, you know, the civil war game happening and being released in America.

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:54.660
<v Mike>Yeah. Do you know, there's, there's some conflict there.

00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:58.420
<v Sean>Um, I mean, this isn't the only, Oh no.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:06:59.380
