<v Sean>Um, I, I think I like the first moment that I like thought, Oh, this is going to be weird

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:33.680
<v Sean>is when in the opening sort of summary, uh, when you start a game in 19 and sorry, in 19,

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:43.320
