00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:44.820
<v Sean>or a real place.

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:50.320
<v Sean>Um, but it was, it was just, I was just sort of like stealing myself for like, this is going

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:54.760
<v Sean>to be weird and it ended up being weird, but we'll, we'll get there.

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:56.740
<v Sean>We'll get there. Yeah.

00:07:56.920 --> 00:08:03.200
<v Mike>So you, you pick a side, the union or the Confederacy, and, um, then you can start the campaign

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:07.340
<v Mike>in, in all different years between 1861 to 1864.

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:09.600
<v Mike>And that does change the, the opening.

