<v Mike>a combination of smart positioning and being good at the mini games?

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:49.040
<v Mike>Or is it, is it like predominantly like just a numbers game or just a, I'm really good with

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:53.960
<v Sean>a controller? I think it's, I'm really good with a controller, at least when it comes to like the one-on-one

00:08:53.960 --> 00:09:00.340
<v Sean>battles. Um, I think it's important to wait, that we actually kind of give a little bit of an overview

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:01.920
