00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:07.680
<v Sean>You have, uh, infantry, cavalry, and artillery.

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:13.740
<v Sean>Now, if this were any other strategy game that we've ever played, there would be like

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:16.540
